# Rust build artifacts. Never tracked.
native/**/target/
# boring-sys ships its build script in build/main.rs — a Rust source file,
# not Gradle output. A bare "build/" rule would exclude it and the engine
# cannot compile without it.
!native/third-party/boring-sys/build/
